[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7322.31, "timestamp": "02:02:02", "text": "你想学哪一个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7324.31, "timestamp": "02:02:04", "text": "呃，我实际上需要打开它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7328.629, "timestamp": "02:02:08", "text": "在另一个标签页上。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7343.83, "timestamp": "02:02:23", "text": "所以，我有两个能造成伤害的进攻手段。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7348.39, "timestamp": "02:02:28", "text": "我想，就是那个小玩意儿和三个实用工具。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7357.03, "timestamp": "02:02:37", "text": "让我看看。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7358.47, "timestamp": "02:02:38", "text": "是的，我的意思是，严格来说，是生产的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7360.55, "timestamp": "02:02:40", "text": "碎片鞭子的作用量相同"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7362.149, "timestamp": "02:02:42", "text": "损害。它们造成的损害同样严重。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7365.03, "timestamp": "02:02:45", "text": "处理产生火焰效用价值"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7366.55, "timestamp": "02:02:46", "text": "从技术上讲，它放弃的更多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7368.629, "timestamp": "02:02:48", "text": "光。"}]